<script setup lang="ts">import {onMounted,watch,ref} from 'vue';import {useRouter} from 'vue-router';import {useStudies} from '../stores/studies';import {useMeasurements} from '../stores/measurements';import {useAuth} from '../stores/auth';import {useTask} from '../hooks/useTask';import StudySelect from '../components/StudySelect.vue';import GradeDots from '../components/GradeDots.vue';import ErrorNotice from '../components/common/ErrorNotice.vue';const study=useStudies(),data=useMeasurements(),auth=useAuth(),router=useRouter(),{error,perform}=useTask(),open=ref(false);onMounted(()=>perform(async()=>{await study.load();if(study.selected)await data.load(study.selected)}));watch(()=>study.selected,id=>{if(id)perform(()=>data.load(id))});async function create(e:Event){const f=new FormData(e.target as HTMLFormElement);await study.save(Object.fromEntries(f));router.push('/data')}</script><template><div class="folio-line"><span>检验折页 / No. 27</span><span>形成等级 Ⅰ—Ⅸ / 独立试样</span></div><StudySelect/><ErrorNotice :error="error"/><section class="opening"><div class="opening-copy"><p class="eyebrow">ONE POOLED RANK SYSTEM</p><h1>先看等级的分布，<br/><em>再问工艺的差异。</em></h1><p class="lead">等级1到9，只有顺序。<br/>把大量并列如实保留，<br/>也把没有显著差异的组对一并留下。</p><div class="study-caption"><b>{{study.current?.name}}</b><p>{{study.current?.protocol}}</p><small>{{study.current?.source_file}}</small></div><RouterLink to="/data" class="text-link">核对全部工艺与独立试样 ↗</RouterLink></div><figure><div class="figure-title"><b>形成等级 · 纵向点阵</b><small>每点一份试样</small></div><GradeDots :treatments="data.treatments" :readings="data.readings"/><figcaption>保留离散等级，不连成连续性能曲线。</figcaption></figure></section><section class="count-strip"><div><small>预定义工艺</small><strong>{{data.treatments.length}}<i>组</i></strong></div><div><small>独立试样</small><strong>{{data.readings.length}}<i>份</i></strong></div><div><small>形成等级</small><strong>1—9</strong></div><p>统一合并排秩 / KW并列修正<br/>全部Dunn组对 / Holm控制检验家族<br/><span>渐近p，不称exact；差异也可能来自分布形状。</span></p></section><section class="workflow"><div><small>01 / 来源</small><h3>先核对独立单位</h3><p>一份试样一次等级；不重复计入、不丢掉空组。</p><RouterLink to="/data">打开来源台账 →</RouterLink></div><div><small>02 / 检验</small><h3>全部工艺，一起冻结</h3><p>相同的合并秩系统，保留并列项、方差与完整组对。</p><RouterLink to="/runs">提交检验队列 →</RouterLink></div><div><small>03 / 复检</small><h3>让说明保留边界</h3><p>分布证据不等于因果或性能概率，先提出独立复检问题。</p><RouterLink to="/notes">阅读复检说明 →</RouterLink></div></section><section v-if="auth.canEdit" class="registry"><button class="text-link" @click="open=!open">{{open?'收起':'＋ 登记新研究折页'}}</button><form v-if="open" class="form-grid" @submit.prevent="e=>perform(()=>create(e))"><label>研究编号<input name="code" required pattern="[A-Za-z0-9_-]+" minLength="2"/></label><label>研究名称<input name="name" required minLength="2"/></label><label>来源文件<input name="source_file"/></label><label>等级/独立单位口径<textarea name="protocol"/></label><button class="primary">登记并核对工艺 →</button></form></section></template>